# Agent Rules (Pos System)

1. Zero external friction: App runs directly with `npm install && npm run dev` in Demo Mode.
2. Complete functional implementation: No dummy alerts, no TODOs, no empty stubs.
3. Financial computations: Integer Rupiah only, strictly tested with Vitest.
4. UI Language: Bahasa Indonesia for user-facing copy. Code and comments: English.
5. All sensitive manager actions (void, refund, excessive discount, price overrides) require Manager PIN modal authorization.
6. Responsive & Ergonomic: 60/40 landscape layout on desktop/tablet, touch target >= 48px, keyboard shortcuts enabled.
